{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 18, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "斥讀斥邱之斥, 文皮, 虎豹之皮也. 『傳』曰：無終子使孟樂因魏 莊子, 納虎豹之皮也, 請和諸戎, 是也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 18, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 13, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0010_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "斥山", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "傳", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "無終", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "孟樂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "魏 莊子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "戎", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0010_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷四 墜形訓 › 東北方之美者, 有斥山之文皮焉.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0010_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 東北方之美者, 有斥山之文皮焉.", "title": "東北方之美者, 有斥山之文皮焉.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 10, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "東方木德仁, 故有君子之國. 其人衣冠帶劍食獸, 使二文虎也. 逵吉按, 『說文解字』曰：東夷從大, 大人也, 夷俗仁, 仁者壽, 有君子不死之國, 卽與此解同.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 10, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 7, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0010_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "逵吉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "說文解字", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "東夷", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0010_0020", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷四 墜形訓 › 東方有君子之國.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0010_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 東方有君子之國.", "title": "東方有君子之國.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 29, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "碣石, 在遼西界海水西畔. 朝鮮, 樂浪之縣也. 貫, 通也. 大人國在其東. 逵吉按, 『太平御覽』 引無山字, 注云：碣石在東北海中. 朝鮮, 東夷. 東方有大人之國也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 29, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 18, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0020_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "碣石山", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "碣石", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "遼西", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樂浪", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "逵吉", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "太平御覽", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "碣石", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東夷", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0020_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷五 時則訓 › 五位, 東方之極, 自碣石山, 過朝鮮, 貫大人之國.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0020_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 五位, 東方之極, 自碣石山, 過朝鮮, 貫大人之國.", "title": "五位, 東方之極, 自碣石山, 過朝鮮, 貫大人之國.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 8, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "箕子, 紂之庶兄. 『論語』云：箕子爲之奴, 武王伐紂, 赦其囚執, 問以洪範, 封之于朝鮮也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 8, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 5, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0030_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "論語", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "洪範", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0030_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷九 主術訓 › 解箕子之囚.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0030_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 解箕子之囚.", "title": "解箕子之囚.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "嘰, 唬也. 知象箸必有玉杯, 爲杯必極滋味.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 27, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 20, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0040_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0040_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十 繆稱訓 › 繩之外與繩之內, 皆失直者也, 紂爲象箸而箕子嘰.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0040_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 繩之外與繩之內, 皆失直者也, 紂爲象箸而箕子嘰.", "title": "繩之外與繩之內, 皆失直者也, 紂爲象箸而箕子嘰.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 51, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "拖, 縱也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 51, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 36, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0050_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "夫差", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "五湖", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "泗", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "貉", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "匈奴", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0050_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十一 齊俗訓 › 然而勝夫差於五湖, 南面而霸天下, 泗上十二諸侯,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0050_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 然而勝夫差於五湖, 南面而霸天下, 泗上十二諸侯, 皆率九夷以朝, 胡·貉·匈奴之國, 縱體拖髮.", "title": "然而勝夫差於五湖, 南面而霸天下, 泗上十二諸侯,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 88, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 67, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0050_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0050_0020", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十一 齊俗訓 › 今世俗之人, 以功成爲賢, 以勝患爲智, 以遭難爲愚,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0050_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 今世俗之人, 以功成爲賢, 以勝患爲智, 以遭難爲愚, 以死節爲戅, 吾以爲各致其所極而已. 王子比干, 非不知箕子被髮佯狂以免其身也. 然以樂直行盡忠以死節, 故不爲也.", "title": "今世俗之人, 以功成爲賢, 以勝患爲智, 以遭難爲愚,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 24, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 19, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0050_0030", "indexTerms": [{"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0050_0030", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十一 齊俗訓 › 今從箕子視比干則愚矣,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0050_0030", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 今從箕子視比干則愚矣, 從比干視箕子則卑矣.", "title": "今從箕子視比干則愚矣,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 36, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "紂死, 箕子亡之朝鮮. 舊居空, 故柴護之也. 逵吉按, 柴護之者, 設軍士護之也, 柴卽俗寨字.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 36, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0060_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "牧野", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "商容", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "逵吉", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0060_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十二 道應訓 › 昔武王伐紂, 破之牧野, 乃封比干之墓,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0060_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 昔武王伐紂, 破之牧野, 乃封比干之墓, 表商容之閭, 柴箕子之門.", "title": "昔武王伐紂, 破之牧野, 乃封比干之墓,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "見象箸, 知當復作玉杯, 有玉杯, 必有熊蹯豹胎, 以極廣侈, 故箕子爲之驚號啼也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 11, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 8, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0070_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0070_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十六 說山訓 › 紂爲象箸而箕子唏.", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0070_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 紂爲象箸而箕子唏.", "title": "紂爲象箸而箕子唏.", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 84, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 59, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0080_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "弦高", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "鄭國", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東夷", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0080_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十八 人閒訓 › 弦高辭之曰：｢誕而得賞, 則鄭國之信廢矣,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0080_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 弦高辭之曰：｢誕而得賞, 則鄭國之信廢矣, 爲國而無信, 是俗敗也. 賞一人而敗國俗, 仁者弗爲也, 以不信得厚賞, 義者弗爲也, 遂以其屬徙東夷, 終身不反.｣.", "title": "弦高辭之曰：｢誕而得賞, 則鄭國之信廢矣,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "蒙公, 蒙恬也. 楊翁子, 秦將.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 43, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "起隴西 臨洮縣.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "遼水, 遼東.", "type": "원주"}, {"id": null, "offset": 55, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "朝鮮, 樂浪.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 57, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 37, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0080_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "胡", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "蒙公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊翁子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "蒙公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "蒙恬", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "楊翁子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "秦", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "脩城", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "流沙", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "隴西", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "臨洮縣", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "遼水", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "遼水", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "遼東", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "樂浪", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0080_0020", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷十八 人閒訓 › 見其傳曰：｢亡秦者胡也, 因發卒五十萬,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0080_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 見其傳曰：｢亡秦者胡也, 因發卒五十萬, 使蒙公·楊翁子, 將築脩城, 西屬流沙, 北擊遼水, 東結朝鮮.｣.", "title": "見其傳曰：｢亡秦者胡也, 因發卒五十萬,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 36, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 26, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0090_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "舜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "許由", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "伊尹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "伯夷", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0090_0010", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷二十 泰族訓 › 舜·許由異行而皆聖, 伊尹·伯夷異道而皆仁,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0090_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 舜·許由異行而皆聖, 伊尹·伯夷異道而皆仁, 箕子·比干異趨而皆賢.", "title": "舜·許由異行而皆聖, 伊尹·伯夷異道而皆仁,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 102, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 69, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_011_ko_011_0090_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "桀", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "湯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "周", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "酆", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "鎬", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "牧之野", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "殷國", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "成湯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "商容", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "比干", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_011_0090_0020", "locator": "淮南子 › 『淮南子』 卷二十 泰族訓 › 故桀·紂不爲王, 湯·武不爲放. 周處酆·鎬之地,", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_011_0090_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_011", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 故桀·紂不爲王, 湯·武不爲放. 周處酆·鎬之地, 方不過百里, 而誓紂 牧之野, 入據殷國, 朝成湯之廟, 表商容之閭, 封比干之墓, 解箕子之囚. 乃折袍毁鼓, 偃五兵, 縱牛馬, 搢笏而朝天下.", "title": "故桀·紂不爲王, 湯·武不爲放. 周處酆·鎬之地,", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
